# What an instance repository never holds. The onboarding run and every later commit of
# an operator's add whatever changed in the checkout; these are the things that change in
# it and are not the repository's.

# secrets: sealed values live under clusters/platform/secrets, encrypted; nothing else
.env
env
*.age
*.key
orbit-recovery-kit*

# opentofu: the providers (hundreds of MB, GitHub refuses the push), the state and the
# variables the run writes from the form stay on the operator machine
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.auto.tfvars
crash.log

# logs: the onboarding run's, and whatever a command was told to write beside it
*.log

# python bytecode from the vendored scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# misc
.DS_Store
.claude/worktrees/
